{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20264AWCOSwCn01795186948.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國際法院裁定緬甸對羅興亞人實行種族滅絕罪名成立，緬甸對裁決深感失望。</p><p></p><p>聯合國最高司法機構荷蘭海牙的國際法院，周四就緬甸軍方在2017年，屠殺羅興亞人案作出裁決。由15人組成的法官小組，以9比6裁定，緬甸清剿羅興亞人構成種族滅絕，違反《防止及懲治滅絕種族罪公約》，且不接受上訴。是國際法院成立逾80年來，首次裁定有主權國干犯相關罪行。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.ICJ.MYANMAR-2300.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026YAkvU7FQkx1795187558.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>緬甸外交部表示深感失望，指其採取的是反恐行動，並無滅絕種族的意圖，又指裁決並非一致通過。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.ICJ.MYANMAR-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265BRzsouYB81795187580.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>中國外交部稱，中方對越權管轄和擴大解釋等問題存在關切，認為有關做法不利於爭端解決。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T15:24:07.260752+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":253,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T14:32:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T15:17:23.692122+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T15:17:23.692122+00:00","content_hash":"5458713dfd8c6b378d476ab54fea979003a65f86f348dfb3a081f4bcedcef377","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}